/home> mkdir /home/sub
/home> mv /home /home/sub
mv: cannot move /home into itself
/home> mv /home /home
mv: cannot move /home into itself
/home> mv / /home/sub
mv: cannot move / into itself
/home> mv /home/welcome.txt /home/welcome.txt
mv: already there: /home/welcome.txt
/home> ls /home
sub/  welcome.txt
/home> mkdir /tmp
mkdir: already there: /tmp
/home> mkdir /home/welcome.txt
mkdir: already there: /home/welcome.txt
/home> mkdir /home/new
/home> mkdir /home/new
mkdir: already there: /home/new
/home> cat /home
cat: is a folder: /home
/home> cat /
cat: is a folder: /
/home> cat nope
cat: not found: /home/nope
